---
import { renderIconSvg } from '../../../../packages/icons/src/icons.generated';
---

<div class="icon-accessibility-examples" data-icon-accessibility-examples>
  <article data-icon-example="decorative">
    <h3>Decorative beside text</h3>
    <p class="example-output">
      <span class="example-icon" set:html={renderIconSvg('download', { size: 24 })} />
      <span>Download report</span>
    </p>
    <p>The visible label carries the meaning, so the SVG stays hidden from assistive technology.</p>
  </article>

  <article data-icon-example="informative">
    <h3>Standalone informative icon</h3>
    <p class="example-output">
      <span
        class="example-icon"
        set:html={renderIconSvg('verified', { size: 24, title: 'Verified account' })}
      />
    </p>
    <p>The SVG is an image with a concise accessible name because no equivalent text is present.</p>
  </article>

  <article data-icon-example="icon-only-control">
    <h3>Named icon-only control</h3>
    <p class="example-output">
      <button type="button" aria-label="Close preview">
        <span class="example-icon" set:html={renderIconSvg('close', { size: 20 })} />
      </button>
    </p>
    <p>The button owns the name and focus; its child SVG remains decorative and unfocusable.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .icon-accessibility-examples {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(13rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-block: 1rem 2rem;
  }

  article {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  }

  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  article > p:last-child {
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .example-output {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 3rem;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
  }

  .example-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  button {
    display: inline-grid;
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg);
    color: var(--sl-color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
